            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"美股｜金銀油本周重挫 市場波動急升 道指一度瀉523點\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"502\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c460bdd15af209a9761bf73d53273a284636b311b82e2c7142b9da3e93fc486b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">美股｜金銀油本周重挫 市場波動急升 道指一度瀉523點</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">美股周三中午走勢分歧。道指報50,236.18點，跌523.24點或1.03%，本周累跌4.03%。納指報24,382.97點，微升0.22%，但本周仍跌3%。金、銀、原油本周齊挫，現貨金跌至每盎司3,742.50美元，本周跌3.7%，白銀本周跌8.19%，WTI原油本周跌7.81%。CBOE波動指數（VIX）日內回落5.22%，但本周急升25.03%至24.13。企業消息方面，思科首季收入185億美元，按年升24%，並上調全年收入指引。Couche-Tard就收購Żabka獲全部監管批准。禮來為賓夕法尼亞州35億美元新廠動工。</p></div>",
